OL,3,GNEWSAWatch thieves take #1m a month,
OL,4,Acourt hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn average of #1m worth of watches is
OL,7,Fstolen from people's wrists in London's
OL,8,FWest End every month, police have said.
OL,10,FThere were 97 watch robberies,
OL,11,Fincluding attempts, across Westminster,
OL,12,FKensington and Chelsea, and Hammersmith
OL,13,Fand Fulham between January and June,
OL,14,Fout of 1,196 robberies in those
OL,15,Fboroughs.
OL,17,FA further 70 watches were stolen
OL,18,Fbetween July and September, the force
OL,19,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
