OL,3,GNEWSAWatch thieves take #1m a month,
OL,4,Acourt hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Met Police figure was given to
OL,7,FSouthwark Crown Court as three men were
OL,8,Fjailed on Friday for stealing a
OL,9,F#137,000 watch that was cut from the
OL,10,Fwrist of Romanian businessman Catalin
OL,11,FBotezatu outside a Mayfair restaurant.
